ok  canal  the rig (locks, barge, bridges, fog and horns, the legging tunnel) and its two foes hold; the level sits between Waymeet and the fair with its own track, opens with a drop and a branch, teaches, develops, twists and examines all five machines and makes each one a lock, combines them in the exam, teaches, tests, remixes and examines the legging tunnel, keeps three checkpoints and Jenny Greenteeth's footprint, and foreshadows her; and in the page the barge carries you, the low beam finds the standing, a paddle fills a lock, a capstan swings a bridge, a horn opens the fog wall, the archers see only the lit, the grindylow grabs and is shaken off, the weeds hold and give, the canal hands you back, in the tunnel she is legged, her lantern dims and lights and draws the brood, the stop-planks wind up
